  "description": "Ever since she was a child, Gaina has been able to see things invisible to others. The power that surpassed even the greatest wizard in the kingdom and the eyes to see the world through a different perspective. \n\nA power so great that even the parents who gave birth to her were afraid of it. \n\nA romance fantasy between Gaina, a girl with a goddess-like appearance and enormous magical powers, and Hitan, a boy who grew up in the hands of the poor descendants of noble people! \n\n**Original Webtoon:** [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56734767), MeToon, [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4178000708)",
